{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ba7bfd299458663874ee8a5cfabade75a2296a42ea3d1340ec50809b70f24895", "ja": "（桃子がゴーレムを操る魔法使い役を務めた\nファンタジー映画は大盛況だ！）", "zh": "（桃子饰演操纵魔像的魔法师的奇幻电影大获成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1001_p", "source_sha256": "38978dc73e525703c603891a8e4a747b73fd1db5b943106c55a17cb765a7b3ee", "ja": "お疲れさま。\n桃子が出演した映画、大好評だな！", "zh": "辛苦了。\n桃子出演的电影大受好评啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "d4e1c3b2980274a14d72644bb084a7c74629b102a22e87c36e41f9f1997fa97d", "ja": "あっ……えへへ。劇場のみんなも見てくれたみたい。\nカッコよかったって、たくさん褒めてくれたの。", "zh": "啊……嘿嘿。剧场的大家好像也都看了呢。\n他们还夸我，说很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "f0a8bc8a27c5a87e0aad6e578eeb4468c21ec590b9ff957e360593cfd79d8909", "ja": "お兄ちゃんは、どうだった？", "zh": "哥哥觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8e636a7719acdacea960cdf47e05547be84a38ac4aaeebb981d1c3aa290387b9", "ja": "もちろん、カッコよかったよ！\n魔女と戦ってるシーンは、色々グッときたな。", "zh": "当然很帅气啦！\n和魔女战斗的那一幕，有好多地方都让我感触颇深呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "286d9a15e0bd67126623678d5bd3ac6a875acb8c3cf82accfded155e612929b7", "ja": "ふふっ、よかった。お話も面白かったし、\n映像の演出も、すごく力が入ってたもんね。", "zh": "呵呵，那就好。故事也很有意思，\n画面的演出也非常用心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "ce7f6cd91e83a689edd51e16fa6f621e4d3fae9dcdd1337127b231a7c827f435", "ja": "魔法もとってもリアルで……。本当に魔法使いに\nなったみたいで、ちょっとだけ感動しちゃった。", "zh": "魔法也特别真实……真的感觉自己成了魔法师，稍微有点感动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "14b4b65105df8655cb31eda800979c1ada842f7940b185d05d6b59d1b3872f06", "ja": "さっきもね、魔法使いになれたらどうする？って\n話してたんだ。", "zh": "刚才还在聊，要是能成为魔法师的话，会做些什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4a4dba4071ab87cf0d52c7d79162d9e4e31cb39d935fd64c0d003eb2874d4ccf", "ja": "魔法使いになれたら、か……。\n桃子なら、どうする？", "zh": "要是能成为魔法师吗……。换作桃子的话，会怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "7c047def8a251882de5f91d0c4cb90333dbaa23c68f3f2048546d2cc35e62188", "ja": "うーん、これっていうのは思いつかないけど……\nライブの時に使える魔法があったら面白いかもね。", "zh": "嗯——虽然暂时想不到特别具体的……\n要是有能在演唱会时使用的魔法，感觉会很有意思呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "8471f2ebdc088c886f4a94b62ae76d9db85ef1f07ea1ff8a7850b6e040422df4", "ja": "熱くない炎とか、濡れない水とか！\nそういうのが使えたら、演出の幅も広がると思うし。", "zh": "不会烫的火焰、不会打湿人的水之类的！\n要是能使用那种东西，我觉得演出的方式也会更加丰富。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e8823adc2256b1fd6da2abe80098ecc25b3e75041b60d7993a9940e9b746a6f2", "ja": "はは、なるほどな。作中みたいに\nゴーレムを召喚したいって言うかと思ったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。我还以为你会说，想像剧中那样召唤魔像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "70cbf001d45b7f85ea815d0e34fdde49e03b764d165d1e1d0e809e9edcefc130", "ja": "それも考えたけど……でも、今はいいかな。\n桃子をサポートしてくれる人はもういるし。", "zh": "我也考虑过……不过，现在就算了吧。\n已经有人会支持桃子了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0107a8ce7b4c191136e16dc43341867966d67ca6aa2dbed6273cc69a96895190", "ja": "桃子……。もしかして……！", "zh": "桃子……难道说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "cad9d18214861de47128502b85490b46d05fa08f20c01b0f5882741543e0ddeb", "ja": "う……も、もう！　お兄ちゃん！\nデリカシーなさすぎ！", "zh": "呜……真、真是的！大哥哥！\n太不解风情了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0623_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0623_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "f014e02e43516fe2e484395bf9638bb7f0badaa3e44576bc052fca9db93866cd", "ja": "ちょっとだけ頼りにしてるけど、まだまだだから！\n気を抜かないように頑張って、お兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "虽然有一点点依赖你，但还差得远呢！\n可别松懈了，要加油哦，哥哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
